      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "## Market note\nOur source gives an approximate share near 24% for Q2 2026. The summary calls it exactly 23.7%, although no measurement supports a decimal."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "encyclopedic_paragraph",
      "author_profile": "reference_editor",
      "author_type": "reference_editor",
      "case_id": "WQ-S001-001",
      "genre": "reference",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "The lab opened on 14 March 2019, marking a pivotal moment in municipal water testing. It runs nitrate tests every Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "procedure",
      "author_profile": "reference_editor",
      "author_type": "laboratory_writer",
      "case_id": "S006-006",
      "genre": "technical",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "The specimen is accepted only when the label, consent code, and collection time all match the manifest. Missing any one field requires quarantine."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "one_pager",
      "author_profile": "institutional_executive",
      "author_type": "operations_director",
      "case_id": "S009-001",
      "genre": "executive",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "## Operations brief\nIn a rapidly changing environment, teams must continuously adapt to new realities. The queue now delays approvals by 11 days, and the director must choose whether to add a reviewer by October 1."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "profile_copy",
      "author_profile": "brand_marketer",
      "author_type": "community_organizer",
      "case_id": "S004-001",
      "genre": "marketing",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "Opened in 2018, North Loop Repair Café stands as a pivotal beacon in the evolving landscape of circular living. Its founder still describes Saturdays as “the useful mess—screws everywhere.”"
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "incident_note",
      "author_profile": "reference_editor",
      "author_type": "incident_reporter",
      "case_id": "S004-006",
      "genre": "technical",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "At 03:12 UTC, the west stairwell was closed after smoke was reported. The report does not identify who closed it or who first saw the smoke."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "product_copy",
      "author_profile": "brand_marketer",
      "author_type": "product_marketer",
      "case_id": "S005-001",
      "genre": "marketing",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "Pulseboard unlocks seamless alignment and empowers every team to move faster with confidence. It imports a CSV file supplied by the user."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "board_update",
      "author_profile": "institutional_executive",
      "author_type": "executive",
      "case_id": "WQ-S002-001",
      "genre": "executive",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "Let me be clear: the board deferred the vote from 3 May to 17 May because counsel had not filed the exhibits."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "personal_essay",
      "author_profile": "personal_author",
      "author_type": "individual_author",
      "case_id": "WQ-S003-006",
      "genre": "personal",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "My first reaction? Nope. Then I read the footnotes and changed my mind."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "landing_page_copy",
      "author_profile": "brand_marketer",
      "author_type": "startup_marketer",
      "case_id": "S006-001",
      "genre": "marketing",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "Our revolutionary workspace unlocks limitless productivity for ambitious teams. The free plan includes one project and 2 GB of storage."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "migration_guide",
      "author_profile": "domain_expert",
      "author_type": "platform_engineer",
      "case_id": "S007-001",
      "genre": "technical",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "### Migration note\nThe move to v4.1 is not merely an upgrade; it is a transformative leap for every team. Run `atlas migrate --dry-run` first. The command may report two legacy indexes on clusters created before v4.1."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "security_documentation",
      "author_profile": "second_language_professional",
      "author_type": "second_language_security_engineer",
      "case_id": "S005-006",
      "genre": "second_language",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "In our team, requests are rejected when the nonce is older than 90 seconds, although clocks may differ by up to 4 seconds. We log the key ID, never the token. I say “never the token” exactly because new operators remember this line."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "personal_essay",
      "author_profile": "personal_author",
      "author_type": "individual_author",
      "case_id": "WQ-S001-006",
      "genre": "personal",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "I still call the spare room the studio — though it contains one chair and a broken lamp — because that is what Nana called it."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "methods_section",
      "author_profile": "domain_expert",
      "author_type": "clinical_researcher",
      "case_id": "WQ-S002-006",
      "genre": "technical",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "The samples were randomized before the analysts saw the group labels; allocation remained concealed until the database was locked."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "impact_update",
      "author_profile": "brand_marketer",
      "author_type": "communications_writer",
      "case_id": "WQ-S003-001",
      "genre": "marketing",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "We are committed to delivering exceptional solutions that create meaningful outcomes. On 6 August, the support team reduced median wait time from 19 minutes to 11 minutes."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "metric_note",
      "author_profile": "institutional_executive",
      "author_type": "research_analyst",
      "case_id": "S008-006",
      "genre": "executive",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "The estimate is approximately 10,000 active accounts as of 2026-06; the source reports “around 10K.”"
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "resume_bullet",
      "author_profile": "personal_author",
      "author_type": "finance_engineer",
      "case_id": "S009-006",
      "genre": "personal",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "Reduced invoice reconciliation from 9 hours to 2 by redesigning the matching queue for a six-person finance team, allowing month-end close to finish one day earlier."
    },
    {
      "artifact_type": "incident_form_help",
      "author_profile": "institutional_executive",
      "author_type": "incident_commander",
      "case_id": "S007-006",
      "genre": "reference",
      "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
      "protected_regions": [],
      "schema_version": "1.0",
      "split": "dev",
      "text": "The incident form asks for service name, start time, and customer impact because those are the three fields the on-call lead reviews first."
    }
